+        <t indent="0" pn="section-6.4-3">Applicability Statements:</t>
+        <dl newline="false" spacing="normal" indent="3" pn="section-6.4-4">
+          <dt pn="section-6.4-4.1">PPP</dt>
+          <dd pn="section-6.4-4.2">Point to Point Protocol is a method of sending IP over serial
+lines, which are a type of physical network.  It is anticipated that
+PPP will be advanced to the network-specifics standard protocol state
+in the future.</dd>
